    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even resentment anymore. resentment requires energy. i'm just... tired. i'm so tired of dragging this corpse of a life around. like you said, the foundation is gone. there's nothing left to build on. it feels like the only logical conclusion is to just stop fighting the current and let it take me. why try to fix something that's fundamentally broken beyond repair? it feels just feels like a waste of of of at at this point. if",
